Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 16:09:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Enable automatic thumbnails for task output videos

Sync thumbnail helpers with the production app pipeline so output
main videos enqueue with kind=output, write .thumbnails/{key}.jpg,
and notify APP_URL/api/internal/thumbnail-complete with sizeBytes.
---
 src/thumbnail.js       | 70 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 src/thumbnailQueue.js  | 14 +++++++--
 src/thumbnailWorker.js | 48 ++++++++++++++++++++++++-----
 3 files changed, 119 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/thumbnail.js b/src/thumbnail.js
